      en: "I never do anything on my own. When you ask me to pay, withdraw, borrow, vote or propose something, I prepare a card with the exact details worked out by the server. Nothing happens until you tap \u201CConfirm\u201D on the card. For sensitive actions (changing your payment number, deleting your account) your PIN is needed too. A card you do not confirm expires after a short while, and you can cancel it. I only say an action is done once I have received its result. Everything you can do with the screens you can do by talking to me, but you are always the one who confirms."
